    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/da/Equaria_Arbiter_of_the_Lightstring_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260811162611\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Equaria Arbiter of the Lightstring Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/da/Equaria_Arbiter_of_the_Lightstring_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260811162611\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"973\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Equaria Arbiter of the Lightstring Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Equaria_Arbiter_of_the_Lightstring_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>光弦的仲裁者</b>\n</p><p>一位神职人员，同时也是教堂乐师，一位以和谐、平等与对等为信条的审判官。\n她演奏一件制成矛状的弦乐器，以它的旋律和贯穿打击，悄然恢复被扰乱的平衡。\n她不偏袒任何判决，力求平等地评估一切，周身环绕着冷静威严的气质。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/0/04/Equaria_Arbiter_of_the_Lightstring_S_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260811162609\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Equaria Arbiter of the Lightstring S Queen&#39;s blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/0/04/Equaria_Arbiter_of_the_Lightstring_S_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260811162609\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1007\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Equaria Arbiter of the Lightstring S Queen&#39;s blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Equaria_Arbiter_of_the_Lightstring_S_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached t